OL,3,GNEWSADonald Trump says unified Ireland
OL,4,Awould be a 'great thing' as he meets
OL,5,AIrish prime minister
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump is speaking
OL,8,Fto business leaders on a two-day visit
OL,9,Fto the Republic of Ireland - watch live
OL,10,Fabove
OL,12,FSpeaking to the media earlier alongside
OL,13,FTaoiseach (Irish Prime Minister)
OL,14,FMicheal Martin, Trump was asked about
OL,15,Fthe prospect of a unified Ireland
OL,17,FTrump says he doesn't want to "cause
OL,18,Fany problems" but he thinks a unified
OL,19,FIreland would be a "great thing",
OL,20,Fadding "I'd love to see it unified"
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
