OL,3,GNEWSADonald Trump says unified Ireland
OL,4,Awould be a 'great thing' as he meets
OL,5,AIrish prime minister
OL,6,
OL,7,F"It's one of those questions where no
OL,8,Fmatter what you say, there's no good
OL,9,Fanswer", the president says, adding
OL,10,Fthat "it would be a cool thing"
OL,12,FDemocratic Unionist Party leader Gavin
OL,13,FRobinson says Northern Ireland's
OL,14,Fconstitutional future "won't be decided
OL,15,Fby commentary in London, Dublin or
OL,16,FWashington"
OL,18,FHe will later travel to his golf resort
OL,19,Fin Doonbeg, County Clare, where the
OL,20,FIrish Open golf tournament is being
OL,21,Fheld - here's a closer look at his
OL,22,Fschedule
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
